Sval: settings and quick actions for Favorites

Finishes Firefox's bookmark-era settings for Sval's Favorites
(favorites-native spec §15.5): General's import button opens Sval's import
page and its text names what Sval imports; the address bar's "Shortcuts"
setting is named for what it does, since Sval's new tab draws no tiles; the
Appearance link to Firefox Home and Home's copy of the default-browser group
go. The address bar's "Manage bookmarks" and "Open Library" quick actions are
removed, because Sval has no Library (decision 0099). Each change is a value
in a settings config or a Fluent string, which no chrome API reaches.

